// generated artifact out of scope BY CONSTRUCTION — the shared helper is scripts/tracked-files.mjs (trackedFiles()).
//
// SCOPE — data/bin only, DELIBERATELY. src / scripts / public carry NO product-dropped untracked files, so a walk
// there is not this hazard (lane fence-hygiene audited every census suite; the report has the table). The CONVERSE is
